(987692, 118109, 6519, '<td valign="top">Of all the voting photos we had in this challenge, I like this the best because it tells a whole story. The blurred hand beautifully suggest that the coin is about to be flipped. The lighting may not be perfect, but its realistic for the situation. "9"</td>', 'Of all the voting photos we had in this challenge, I like this the best because it tells a whole story. The blurred hand beautifully suggest that the coin is about to be flipped. The lighting may not be perfect, but its realistic for the situation. "9"', '2004-11-03 01:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
