(988781, 117940, 3087, '<td valign="top">My favourite entry in this challenge. I love the detail in the textures of both metal and brush hairs. Toned black and white looks great. Only minor minus point is the doobries at the top left and bottom right corners. Is that from a hood or just a regular zoom?</td>', 'My favourite entry in this challenge. I love the detail in the textures of both metal and brush hairs. Toned black and white looks great. Only minor minus point is the doobries at the top left and bottom right corners. Is that from a hood or just a regular zoom?', '2004-11-03 12:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(988794, 118000, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of lighting and color, but I don''t understand the title.  Still very clear and warm. 7</td>', 'I like the choice of lighting and color, but I don''t understand the title.  Still very clear and warm. 7', '2004-11-03 12:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(988800, 118131, 12131, '<td valign="top">I wonder how you did this.  Did you hold the shutter open as you drove past?  I think its interesting and clear while somewhat impressionistic at the same time.  It''s almost half and half with a diagonal line and all that...I like it. 8</td>', 'I wonder how you did this.  Did you hold the shutter open as you drove past?  I think its interesting and clear while somewhat impressionistic at the same time.  It''s almost half and half with a diagonal line and all that...I like it. 8', '2004-11-03 12:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(988805, 118197, 12131, '<td valign="top">Okay, I get this interpretation.  I like the lighting and the clarity.  I think I could do without the title though.  Just let the photo speak for itself, you know? 7</td>', 'Okay, I get this interpretation.  I like the lighting and the clarity.  I think I could do without the title though.  Just let the photo speak for itself, you know? 7', '2004-11-03 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(988806, 118186, 12131, '<td valign="top">Nice choice.  I wonder how often that happens...</td>', 'Nice choice.  I wonder how often that happens...', '2004-11-03 12:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(988809, 117964, 12131, '<td valign="top">How did you get both lit up at the same time?  Good photo.  9</td>', 'How did you get both lit up at the same time?  Good photo.  9', '2004-11-03 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(988813, 117892, 12131, '<td valign="top">I think I would understand this more if the hand was hovering over the knight and not holding it.  As it is, I can''t tell what the options are.  Still, the clarity and the lighting are excellent and I like the way the hand just appears.  7</td>', 'I think I would understand this more if the hand was hovering over the knight and not holding it.  As it is, I can''t tell what the options are.  Still, the clarity and the lighting are excellent and I like the way the hand just appears.  7', '2004-11-03 12:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(988815, 117923, 24846, '<td valign="top">It''s Kerry. Surprised by how few political photo''s considering the name. Nice rich color of the desk contrasts nice with the magazine, like the vertical crop...</td>', 'It''s Kerry. Surprised by how few political photo''s considering the name. Nice rich color of the desk contrasts nice with the magazine, like the vertical crop...', '2004-11-03 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(988818, 118113, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong, but predictable.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: This is quite bland, uninteresting and not particularly well shot. It appears to be shot with flash or overhead lighting which has flattened it and gives it a snapshot look. Composition is OK.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: none.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong, but predictable. Image critique: This is quite bland, uninteresting and not particularly well shot. It appears to be shot with flash or overhead lighting which has flattened it and gives it a snapshot look. Composition is OK. Out of challenge interest: none.', '2004-11-03 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(988822, 117911, 12131, '<td valign="top">RIght!  Like I''d have any trouble choosing here.  I would go chocolate any day!  Still, I like the subject and the . . .closeness I guess you''d call it.  8</td>', 'RIght!  Like I''d have any trouble choosing here.  I would go chocolate any day!  Still, I like the subject and the . . .closeness I guess you''d call it.  8', '2004-11-03 12:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(988823, 118138, 24846, '<td valign="top">Nice macro on this political statement. Troubling to think that was how many people decided. Nice job...</td>', 'Nice macro on this political statement. Troubling to think that was how many people decided. Nice job...', '2004-11-03 12:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(988828, 117939, 16648, '<td valign="top">nice, but could use a tad more DOF - the upper right is losing focus</td>', 'nice, but could use a tad more DOF - the upper right is losing focus', '2004-11-03 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(988832, 118190, 24846, '<td valign="top">lol. Nice capture...</td>', 'lol. Nice capture...', '2004-11-03 12:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(988833, 118098, 12131, '<td valign="top">10 for clarity, creativity, framing, and that sign.</td>', '10 for clarity, creativity, framing, and that sign.', '2004-11-03 12:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(988834, 117995, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium, but more like ''Choices''.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: Not very appealing I''m afraid. Composition is OK, but lighting is flat (face-on flash), burns out the highlights and the shot suffers from sever sharpening and/or compression artifacts.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: none.</td>', 'Challenge link: medium, but more like ''Choices''. Image critique: Not very appealing I''m afraid. Composition is OK, but lighting is flat (face-on flash), burns out the highlights and the shot suffers from sever sharpening and/or compression artifacts. Out of challenge interest: none.', '2004-11-03 12:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(988836, 118129, 16648, '<td valign="top">focus focus focus</td>', 'focus focus focus', '2004-11-03 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(988840, 118104, 12131, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo but I don''t understand how it meets the challenge.  Love the warmth in it. 6</td>', 'Beautiful photo but I don''t understand how it meets the challenge.  Love the warmth in it. 6', '2004-11-03 12:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(988842, 117928, 16648, '<td valign="top">too dark, too small, not sharp</td>', 'too dark, too small, not sharp', '2004-11-03 12:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(988845, 118099, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this except for the second half of the title.  I can see the color choice for myself . . . and I really like it.  9</td>', 'I like this except for the second half of the title.  I can see the color choice for myself . . . and I really like it.  9', '2004-11-03 12:39:16.000000', NULL, 1);
