(988904, 118004, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: odd!<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: Quite a plain image, presneting some strange objects in a rather boring way I''m afraid. Lighting is quite warm but the layout of the objects is not engaging and I don''t really know what I''m supposed to think here. Sorry.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: none - apart from finding out what these are!  : )</td>', 'Challenge link: odd! Image critique: Quite a plain image, presneting some strange objects in a rather boring way I''m afraid. Lighting is quite warm but the layout of the objects is not engaging and I don''t really know what I''m supposed to think here. Sorry. Out of challenge interest: none - apart from finding out what these are!  : )', '2004-11-03 13:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(988914, 117898, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: it''s more ''Choices'' for me.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: A bit dull overall. There''s not much here to grab the attention or keep me looking. Composition is OK but unimaginative. Crop is too tight on hand. Objects arranged too boringly.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: none.</td>', 'Challenge link: it''s more ''Choices'' for me. Image critique: A bit dull overall. There''s not much here to grab the attention or keep me looking. Composition is OK but unimaginative. Crop is too tight on hand. Objects arranged too boringly. Out of challenge interest: none.', '2004-11-03 13:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(988915, 118122, 23312, '<td valign="top">Nice setup - the shadows give it away a little, but it looks like that would be hard to avoid.  "A" for effort certainly!</td>', 'Nice setup - the shadows give it away a little, but it looks like that would be hard to avoid.  "A" for effort certainly!', '2004-11-03 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(988918, 118121, 23312, '<td valign="top">Pretty depressing, but the blue cast makes it effective.</td>', 'Pretty depressing, but the blue cast makes it effective.', '2004-11-03 13:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(988919, 118145, 3032, '<td valign="top">Ballantine''s sucks, this Jack Daniels is ok, but I''d go for the Courvoisier.<br/>Ever tries Chabasse (cognac)? It is really good.<br/> <br/>Phototech wise I think the lighting leaves a lot to be desired, but I know it ain''t easy to get it perfect with the ghost hands in such short time.</td>', 'Ballantine''s sucks, this Jack Daniels is ok, but I''d go for the Courvoisier.Ever tries Chabasse (cognac)? It is really good. Phototech wise I think the lighting leaves a lot to be desired, but I know it ain''t easy to get it perfect with the ghost hands in such short time.', '2004-11-03 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(988923, 118074, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: OK, but not very appealing. Light is flat. Movement of hands adds the indecisive element.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: none.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong. Image critique: OK, but not very appealing. Light is flat. Movement of hands adds the indecisive element. Out of challenge interest: none.', '2004-11-03 13:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(988927, 118174, 23312, '<td valign="top">Funny, interesting composition lighting and texture - and topical - I like it!</td>', 'Funny, interesting composition lighting and texture - and topical - I like it!', '2004-11-03 13:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(988934, 118211, 23312, '<td valign="top">Nice setup - I wish we could see the open eyes of the bush person.</td>', 'Nice setup - I wish we could see the open eyes of the bush person.', '2004-11-03 13:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(988936, 118108, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong, but predictable.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a nice attempt at creative lighting and unusual composition. Just a bit unengaging really.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: not much.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong, but predictable. Image critique: a nice attempt at creative lighting and unusual composition. Just a bit unengaging really. Out of challenge interest: not much.', '2004-11-03 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(988942, 118029, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong but samey and predicatble.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: blurred, poorly focused, gloomily lit and average composition. Sorry.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: none.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong but samey and predicatble. Image critique: blurred, poorly focused, gloomily lit and average composition. Sorry. Out of challenge interest: none.', '2004-11-03 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(988947, 118144, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: weak - this says ''Choices'' to me.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: good composition, nasty border, slightly soft focus, tones a bit harsh.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: not much.</td>', 'Challenge link: weak - this says ''Choices'' to me. Image critique: good composition, nasty border, slightly soft focus, tones a bit harsh. Out of challenge interest: not much.', '2004-11-03 13:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(988951, 118003, 23312, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of contrast.  Lighting isn''t so good.  Focus is a bit soft.  I''d be tempted to crop a little of the dark area on the left.  But, I''ll give you an 8 for a very creative idea!</td>', 'Not a lot of contrast.  Lighting isn''t so good.  Focus is a bit soft.  I''d be tempted to crop a little of the dark area on the left.  But, I''ll give you an 8 for a very creative idea!', '2004-11-03 13:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(988961, 117814, 23312, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the execution.  I wonder if a little shallower depth of field would help put more emphasis on the keys and phone - but that might be hard to achieve with the shaky effect.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the execution.  I wonder if a little shallower depth of field would help put more emphasis on the keys and phone - but that might be hard to achieve with the shaky effect.', '2004-11-03 13:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(988966, 118131, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: quite strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: a very interesting composition and approach. Dynamic composition and some nice use of long exposure. It doesn''t sing of indecision but at least it''s pretty. The hot spots are quite distracting.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: yes, quite artistic.</td>', 'Challenge link: quite strong. Image critique: a very interesting composition and approach. Dynamic composition and some nice use of long exposure. It doesn''t sing of indecision but at least it''s pretty. The hot spots are quite distracting. Out of challenge interest: yes, quite artistic.', '2004-11-03 13:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(988969, 117892, 23312, '<td valign="top">Sorry to be a nit-picker, but if that Knight is being moved from it''s starting square, there isn''t any indecion about where it can go...  but who cares?  I like the idea - I wonder if showing more of the board or having it a little tilted would add a little drama - to make the viewer feel some of the worry of the indecision of the potential move.</td>', 'Sorry to be a nit-picker, but if that Knight is being moved from it''s starting square, there isn''t any indecion about where it can go...  but who cares?  I like the idea - I wonder if showing more of the board or having it a little tilted would add a little drama - to make the viewer feel some of the worry of the indecision of the potential move.', '2004-11-03 13:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(988974, 117887, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong. This cenario is very familiar to me!  ; )<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: I love the compostion here and the cat''s angle is just great - that pose where the tail flicks a bit as they wait around letting all the cold air in! My main problem with this is the destruction of your image in a gimmicky treatment. The effect on the door fram is nice, but the rest becomes too distressed and undoes your good work. I''d have preferred simply a harsh, contrasty black &amp; white of this.<br/> <br/>Will probably be voted low because of the FX.<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: yes, fairly strong as an image.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong. This cenario is very familiar to me!  ; ) Image critique: I love the compostion here and the cat''s angle is just great - that pose where the tail flicks a bit as they wait around letting all the cold air in! My main problem with this is the destruction of your image in a gimmicky treatment. The effect on the door fram is nice, but the rest becomes too distressed and undoes your good work. I''d have preferred simply a harsh, contrasty black & white of this. Will probably be voted low because of the FX. Out of challenge interest: yes, fairly strong as an image.', '2004-11-03 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(988977, 118099, 24642, '<td valign="top">Creative.</td>', 'Creative.', '2004-11-03 13:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(988986, 117847, 27293, '<td valign="top">Should have at least cleaned up the digital noise.</td>', 'Should have at least cleaned up the digital noise.', '2004-11-03 13:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(988990, 117942, 27293, '<td valign="top">Missing focus... and this is not the kind of a picture that looks good w/o something in focus, imo.</td>', 'Missing focus... and this is not the kind of a picture that looks good w/o something in focus, imo.', '2004-11-03 13:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(988992, 118122, 27416, '<td valign="top">very cool Idea for a shot it turned out really well good job<br/></td>', 'very cool Idea for a shot it turned out really well good job', '2004-11-03 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(988997, 117995, 27293, '<td valign="top">This looks a little over-photoshopped... on the face especially. plus a flash right between the eyes... all negative factors with me. But a nice illustration of the challenge. 6. Edit: lowering to 4. This time i am using the full scale, instead of my usual 5-10. Also, i didn''t mention a whole lot of blown highlights on the labels and caps.</td>', 'This looks a little over-photoshopped... on the face especially. plus a flash right between the eyes... all negative factors with me. But a nice illustration of the challenge. 6. Edit: lowering to 4. This time i am using the full scale, instead of my usual 5-10. Also, i didn''t mention a whole lot of blown highlights on the labels and caps.', '2004-11-03 13:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(989000, 117999, 27293, '<td valign="top">gotta be a little more creative than this...</td>', 'gotta be a little more creative than this...', '2004-11-03 13:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(989002, 117933, 1, '<td valign="top">A good shot, but the lack of sharpness on the thumb/quarter are holding me back from voting higher.</td>', 'A good shot, but the lack of sharpness on the thumb/quarter are holding me back from voting higher.', '2004-11-03 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(989003, 118000, 27293, '<td valign="top">Which home? Doesn''t make much sense...</td>', 'Which home? Doesn''t make much sense...', '2004-11-03 13:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
