(989012, 118191, 1, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure that''s the Washington Monument, but it''s not completely evident.  A longer exposure could have corrected the darkness in this photograph.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure that''s the Washington Monument, but it''s not completely evident.  A longer exposure could have corrected the darkness in this photograph.', '2004-11-03 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
