(990532, 117980, 22010, '<td valign="top">Definitely the coke. There''s some noise in the picture. If the lighting were better, that may have helped with the noise. Good luck.</td>', 'Definitely the coke. There''s some noise in the picture. If the lighting were better, that may have helped with the noise. Good luck.', '2004-11-03 23:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
