(990539, 118074, 22010, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I like the separate paper(line) for each hand. I see why you did it though. It seems a bit on the bright side. I''d go with the right hand.</td>', 'I''m not sure if I like the separate paper(line) for each hand. I see why you did it though. It seems a bit on the bright side. I''d go with the right hand.', '2004-11-04 00:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
