(990544, 118026, 22010, '<td valign="top">Good use of the model. It seems a bit off focus, that could just be me. Also, the flash is distracting. If it''s not a flash, the lamp is distracting. This would''ve been even more effective had it been taken with a softer light source? Dunno. One of my top pics so far.</td>', 'Good use of the model. It seems a bit off focus, that could just be me. Also, the flash is distracting. If it''s not a flash, the lamp is distracting. This would''ve been even more effective had it been taken with a softer light source? Dunno. One of my top pics so far.', '2004-11-04 00:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(990548, 118132, 22010, '<td valign="top">Good composition. On topic. Wonderful colors. Effective border. What can I say? Nice job.</td>', 'Good composition. On topic. Wonderful colors. Effective border. What can I say? Nice job.', '2004-11-04 00:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
