(990552, 118068, 22010, '<td valign="top">A bit fuzzy. Cropped it a bit close though. And not sure if the B&amp;W helps. An orange carrot might''ve worked better. The kid will probably choose the stick.</td>', 'A bit fuzzy. Cropped it a bit close though. And not sure if the B&W helps. An orange carrot might''ve worked better. The kid will probably choose the stick.', '2004-11-04 00:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
