(990729, 118000, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: you own all those houses? Blimey.  : )<br/> <br/>Seriously though - it''s a great concept since burglars must actually go through this process in some form. The dark, stylised, ominous treatment works really well - and for this challenge it''s great to see some effort made at a creative solution. My tip for the top (if the US election pics don''t get chosen by default!).<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: this works as a good image despite the challenge.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong. Image critique: you own all those houses? Blimey.  : ) Seriously though - it''s a great concept since burglars must actually go through this process in some form. The dark, stylised, ominous treatment works really well - and for this challenge it''s great to see some effort made at a creative solution. My tip for the top (if the US election pics don''t get chosen by default!). Out of challenge interest: this works as a good image despite the challenge.', '2004-11-04 04:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(990745, 118112, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: crisp, proficient, stock art. Composition is too central for me, so just one fully petalled flower and getting closer would improve it. Concept is good, if a little tacky.<br/> <br/>Will probably get in the ribbons (not that that will be anything to shout about in this challenge!!).<br/> <br/><b>Out of challenge interest</b>: medium - if you like that kind of thing.<br/></td>', 'Challenge link: strong. Image critique: crisp, proficient, stock art. Composition is too central for me, so just one fully petalled flower and getting closer would improve it. Concept is good, if a little tacky. Will probably get in the ribbons (not that that will be anything to shout about in this challenge!!). Out of challenge interest: medium - if you like that kind of thing.', '2004-11-04 04:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
