(991194, 117808, 8759, '<td valign="top">Not lining in the USA and never been there. I am pretty far from these political issues, but I can still feel indecision in you pic. Fits well the challenge. Technically not so great though. The crop should ne tighter IMO. The poor light on the hands does not help a lot. Good luck 6 (maily for meeting the challenge)</td>', 'Not lining in the USA and never been there. I am pretty far from these political issues, but I can still feel indecision in you pic. Fits well the challenge. Technically not so great though. The crop should ne tighter IMO. The poor light on the hands does not help a lot. Good luck 6 (maily for meeting the challenge)', '2004-11-04 09:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
