(991301, 117892, 24846, '<td valign="top">Love the deep colors, dof, hand out of black, a technically wonderful shot. However no indecision. I''m not trying to be a stickler, but there is not even a choice. The only place to move that Knight is to f3. So the title is appropriate.<br/>Great image...</td>', 'Love the deep colors, dof, hand out of black, a technically wonderful shot. However no indecision. I''m not trying to be a stickler, but there is not even a choice. The only place to move that Knight is to f3. So the title is appropriate.Great image...', '2004-11-04 10:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
