(991421, 118099, 27562, '<td valign="top">Great image, I really like both character''s expressions.  I gave the image a 9.  <br/> <br/>I think just "Beer or babe" would have been a better title.  The selective B&amp;W, I feel, is over used, but it really adds to your image.  I just think the observer doesn''t need the info in the title it will become obvious when viewing the image.<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'Great image, I really like both character''s expressions.  I gave the image a 9.   I think just "Beer or babe" would have been a better title.  The selective B&W, I feel, is over used, but it really adds to your image.  I just think the observer doesn''t need the info in the title it will become obvious when viewing the image. Great job!', '2004-11-04 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
