(991474, 117814, 27847, '<td valign="top">I presumed in this shot that you were trying to have the whole picture out of focus a bit (kind of to represent the normal Saturday night out ;-). So I rated it for what it was and you have a great message and idea for this shot. Good Work.</td>', 'I presumed in this shot that you were trying to have the whole picture out of focus a bit (kind of to represent the normal Saturday night out ;-). So I rated it for what it was and you have a great message and idea for this shot. Good Work.', '2004-11-04 11:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
