(991639, 118130, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium/strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: while it''s well composed this doesn''t hold much interest apart from meeting the brief. Lighting is quite flat and there''s not much to hold interest for long. However, it''s well focused and captured. Expression is good.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: little.</td>', 'Challenge link: medium/strong. Image critique: while it''s well composed this doesn''t hold much interest apart from meeting the brief. Lighting is quite flat and there''s not much to hold interest for long. However, it''s well focused and captured. Expression is good. Out-of-challenge appeal: little.', '2004-11-04 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
