(991647, 118209, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: medium - this is very much a ''Choice'' rather than indecision, which has not been illustrated clearly. If I were to look at the pic outside of the challenge I would imagine that the theme was ''Depression'' or ''Desolation''.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: this is by far the best quality image in the challenge. Clear, crisp and very satisfying to llok at. Well composed and lit.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: it''s a nice quality image - good for stock art.</td>', 'Challenge link: medium - this is very much a ''Choice'' rather than indecision, which has not been illustrated clearly. If I were to look at the pic outside of the challenge I would imagine that the theme was ''Depression'' or ''Desolation''. Image critique: this is by far the best quality image in the challenge. Clear, crisp and very satisfying to llok at. Well composed and lit. Out-of-challenge appeal: it''s a nice quality image - good for stock art.', '2004-11-04 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
