(993813, 118098, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: HaHaaa - but will it work? Will he go or will he stay?<br/> <br/>Solid, creative, cute idea. Like it muchly (border is too heavy though).  :D<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: yes - it''s funny.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong. Image critique: HaHaaa - but will it work? Will he go or will he stay? Solid, creative, cute idea. Like it muchly (border is too heavy though).  :D Out-of-challenge appeal: yes - it''s funny.', '2004-11-05 17:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(993822, 117942, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: yes, she looks indecisive. It''s just that the image is washed out and not very appealing. So if the challenge brief is everything - you''ve achieved what you wanted. But if you don''t want to get fed up with seeing a shot in your portfolio then you may have failed!<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: none.</td>', 'Challenge link: strong. Image critique: yes, she looks indecisive. It''s just that the image is washed out and not very appealing. So if the challenge brief is everything - you''ve achieved what you wanted. But if you don''t want to get fed up with seeing a shot in your portfolio then you may have failed! Out-of-challenge appeal: none.', '2004-11-05 17:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
