(994150, 117964, 6667, '<td valign="top">While I think the image is fantastic, my question is,  is this indecision or a command?!</td>', 'While I think the image is fantastic, my question is,  is this indecision or a command?!', '2004-11-05 21:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(994204, 118106, 17203, '<td valign="top">The choice here is apparent, but not the indecision. a hand hovering over the clubs would help greatly. You might also have a more compelling image if the background depicted a somewhat blurry view down the fairway, with the flag in the top right corner.</td>', 'The choice here is apparent, but not the indecision. a hand hovering over the clubs would help greatly. You might also have a more compelling image if the background depicted a somewhat blurry view down the fairway, with the flag in the top right corner.', '2004-11-05 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(994210, 117808, 17203, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you''ve shown an eraser here, rather than the marking end. A nice touch.</td>', 'I like the fact that you''ve shown an eraser here, rather than the marking end. A nice touch.', '2004-11-05 21:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(994231, 118145, 17203, '<td valign="top">A decent concept, but I almost missed the hand. The bottles are so strong, that the subtle hand is easy to overlook. The white balance is off, too, but I do respect the difficulty of capturing the hand at all.</td>', 'A decent concept, but I almost missed the hand. The bottles are so strong, that the subtle hand is easy to overlook. The white balance is off, too, but I do respect the difficulty of capturing the hand at all.', '2004-11-05 21:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(994249, 118121, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hey, it''s just a game. You''ll better on other challenges! Don''t give up hope! ;-)<br/> <br/>The high contrast and blown-out pills are negatives for me, though appropriate to the concept. A bigger problem may be that your subject appears to have made a decision already.</td>', 'Hey, it''s just a game. You''ll better on other challenges! Don''t give up hope! ;-) The high contrast and blown-out pills are negatives for me, though appropriate to the concept. A bigger problem may be that your subject appears to have made a decision already.', '2004-11-05 22:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994258, 117945, 17203, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept and a good image technically, but your score will likely suffer from portraying an inanimate object as decisive. There''s really no mind to make up.</td>', 'An interesting concept and a good image technically, but your score will likely suffer from portraying an inanimate object as decisive. There''s really no mind to make up.', '2004-11-05 22:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(994267, 117892, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think it would help to have some reference to the time spent deciding- a calendar, dust on the pieces, etc. Otherwise, you could just as easily be depicting an immediate decision (there''s only one move that knight can make, after all).</td>', 'Good idea, but I think it would help to have some reference to the time spent deciding- a calendar, dust on the pieces, etc. Otherwise, you could just as easily be depicting an immediate decision (there''s only one move that knight can make, after all).', '2004-11-05 22:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(994271, 117966, 17203, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S a good find! I amost shot something similar- a license plate that read, "WHATEVER." I think this shot would be even stronger if you cropped off the left half, putting the focus on the bumper stickers alone. 7</td>', 'Now THAT''S a good find! I amost shot something similar- a license plate that read, "WHATEVER." I think this shot would be even stronger if you cropped off the left half, putting the focus on the bumper stickers alone. 7', '2004-11-05 22:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(994273, 117830, 17203, '<td valign="top">Funny shot and good DOF, but it looks like the dog''s mind is pretty well made up. ;-)</td>', 'Funny shot and good DOF, but it looks like the dog''s mind is pretty well made up. ;-)', '2004-11-05 22:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(994274, 117975, 17203, '<td valign="top">Funny. It''s a shame the cat wasn''t in better focus.</td>', 'Funny. It''s a shame the cat wasn''t in better focus.', '2004-11-05 22:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(994284, 118121, 27293, '<td valign="top">I think something like this was already in the ''choices'' challenge...</td>', 'I think something like this was already in the ''choices'' challenge...', '2004-11-05 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(994289, 118097, 17203, '<td valign="top">I see where you''re going with this (pun intended), but it''s missing something. There''s a choice, but no one to make it. If you had a bicyclist stopped in the center or someone standing outside a car, then I think it would be a stronger representation of indecision. I''d also crop off the top 1/2 inch to minimize the bright sky.</td>', 'I see where you''re going with this (pun intended), but it''s missing something. There''s a choice, but no one to make it. If you had a bicyclist stopped in the center or someone standing outside a car, then I think it would be a stronger representation of indecision. I''d also crop off the top 1/2 inch to minimize the bright sky.', '2004-11-05 22:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(994292, 118205, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good composition and DOF, and a unique take on the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Good composition and DOF, and a unique take on the challenge. Well done.', '2004-11-05 22:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(994301, 118055, 17203, '<td valign="top">You started with a good concept (as evidenced by the number of coins among the entries), but painterly effects invariably get hammered in the voting.</td>', 'You started with a good concept (as evidenced by the number of coins among the entries), but painterly effects invariably get hammered in the voting.', '2004-11-05 22:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(994305, 118198, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good color and composition. An interesting shot, but I don''t think it''ll score as well as you might have hoped. Without the title, there''s little evidence of indecision IMO.</td>', 'Good color and composition. An interesting shot, but I don''t think it''ll score as well as you might have hoped. Without the title, there''s little evidence of indecision IMO.', '2004-11-05 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(994306, 118036, 17203, '<td valign="top">Funny. Not exactly a poster child for brand loyalty are you?</td>', 'Funny. Not exactly a poster child for brand loyalty are you?', '2004-11-05 22:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(994321, 118053, 17203, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and concept. Pity it''s so true. I think the image could be a little brighter, and the pencil appears soft to me- and not just because it says so. ;-P</td>', 'Excellent composition and concept. Pity it''s so true. I think the image could be a little brighter, and the pencil appears soft to me- and not just because it says so. ;-P', '2004-11-05 22:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(994329, 118122, 17203, '<td valign="top">Clever! Looks like you shot this with all the coins standing on a sheet of paper (the shadows and traces of adhesive give it away). I think it might be a little more natural to flip the image so you''d have a right-handed person and a time progression from left to right. 8</td>', 'Clever! Looks like you shot this with all the coins standing on a sheet of paper (the shadows and traces of adhesive give it away). I think it might be a little more natural to flip the image so you''d have a right-handed person and a time progression from left to right. 8', '2004-11-05 23:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(994332, 118074, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good concept, not so good white balance. Clever use of paper to provide the split frame down the middle.</td>', 'Good concept, not so good white balance. Clever use of paper to provide the split frame down the middle.', '2004-11-05 23:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(994333, 118118, 17203, '<td valign="top">Weird green glow- and I''m not so sure it''s intentional. The zipper is distracting, too. Good idea, but not everyone will understand the Matrix reference.</td>', 'Weird green glow- and I''m not so sure it''s intentional. The zipper is distracting, too. Good idea, but not everyone will understand the Matrix reference.', '2004-11-05 23:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994338, 118174, 17203, '<td valign="top">Fun-E! While not a very strong representation of indecision, I love the humor. 9</td>', 'Fun-E! While not a very strong representation of indecision, I love the humor. 9', '2004-11-05 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(994340, 118129, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it looks like you got too close to focus. Make sure you use the macro setting for a shot like this if you have one.</td>', 'Good idea, but it looks like you got too close to focus. Make sure you use the macro setting for a shot like this if you have one.', '2004-11-05 23:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(994361, 118133, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hi ,Paul (presumably). Funny shot, though I suspect it''s not doing so well in the voting. :-( The connection to indecision is pretty weak (the boy can''t vote, thus he couldn''t be deciding between those choices). For a strong connection, this type of shot probably requires competing campaign signs, with a confused voter between them.</td>', 'Hi ,Paul (presumably). Funny shot, though I suspect it''s not doing so well in the voting. :-( The connection to indecision is pretty weak (the boy can''t vote, thus he couldn''t be deciding between those choices). For a strong connection, this type of shot probably requires competing campaign signs, with a confused voter between them.', '2004-11-05 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(994366, 118197, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Elegant in its simplicity. 8</td>', 'Great concept. Elegant in its simplicity. 8', '2004-11-05 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(994378, 117934, 22010, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but as I''m sure you already know, the concept of using the coin to represent indecision is very "common". It is done more effectively here though. Technically, this shot is very good. The negative space is also very effective. Good luck!</td>', 'This is nice, but as I''m sure you already know, the concept of using the coin to represent indecision is very "common". It is done more effectively here though. Technically, this shot is very good. The negative space is also very effective. Good luck!', '2004-11-05 23:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(994382, 117847, 17203, '<td valign="top">Even with the title, I''m afraid the challenge connection is rather weak. Cool cloud formation though.</td>', 'Even with the title, I''m afraid the challenge connection is rather weak. Cool cloud formation though.', '2004-11-05 23:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(994384, 117986, 22010, '<td valign="top">The squirrel is too dark and so I think the focus is on the branches. These shots tend to be so busy as the branches are very distracting. Unless that was the point.</td>', 'The squirrel is too dark and so I think the focus is on the branches. These shots tend to be so busy as the branches are very distracting. Unless that was the point.', '2004-11-05 23:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(994387, 118186, 17203, '<td valign="top">Briliant concept. Perhaps a little more off-centered composition?</td>', 'Briliant concept. Perhaps a little more off-centered composition?', '2004-11-05 23:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(994390, 117995, 22010, '<td valign="top">Wow, her eyes are very very green. Compositionally, I think this shot is great. Technically, you seemed to have done so much editing that I can''t truly appreciate it. I do like this picture though.</td>', 'Wow, her eyes are very very green. Compositionally, I think this shot is great. Technically, you seemed to have done so much editing that I can''t truly appreciate it. I do like this picture though.', '2004-11-05 23:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(994394, 118097, 10275, '<td valign="top">Finally a neat idea that doesn''t involve US politics. This definitely meets the challenge. Nice greenery.</td>', 'Finally a neat idea that doesn''t involve US politics. This definitely meets the challenge. Nice greenery.', '2004-11-05 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(994396, 118028, 22010, '<td valign="top">The idea is a good one. The blurred finger is probably intentional and I don''t mind that it''s out of focus since the remote is in focus. The rug/carpet is the thing that bothers me. The colors are not very useful in this picture.</td>', 'The idea is a good one. The blurred finger is probably intentional and I don''t mind that it''s out of focus since the remote is in focus. The rug/carpet is the thing that bothers me. The colors are not very useful in this picture.', '2004-11-05 23:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(994399, 117940, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on this challenge. Like the colour treatment.</td>', 'Very nice take on this challenge. Like the colour treatment.', '2004-11-05 23:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(994400, 117974, 22010, '<td valign="top">Great signs. Technically superb. It''s just not a great picture. Good though.</td>', 'Great signs. Technically superb. It''s just not a great picture. Good though.', '2004-11-05 23:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(994401, 118153, 17203, '<td valign="top">Best expression in the group. The light on the face, and focus on the hand could be better, but still one of the strongest entries in the group.</td>', 'Best expression in the group. The light on the face, and focus on the hand could be better, but still one of the strongest entries in the group.', '2004-11-05 23:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
