(994578, 118078, 23300, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Expert use of lighting and Black and White. The composition works well including the square format. The dark patch in the top left is a little distracting but does not detract enough from the image to make any real impact. Its a quirky and suprisingly powerful image. Good Luck.</td>', 'Very nice image. Expert use of lighting and Black and White. The composition works well including the square format. The dark patch in the top left is a little distracting but does not detract enough from the image to make any real impact. Its a quirky and suprisingly powerful image. Good Luck.', '2004-11-06 01:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(994585, 117964, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image takes the theme and represents it in its basic form. Two opposing choices presented at the same time. It really presents a sense of tension. The composition works well to highlight the choices.</td>', 'This image takes the theme and represents it in its basic form. Two opposing choices presented at the same time. It really presents a sense of tension. The composition works well to highlight the choices.', '2004-11-06 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
