(994614, 118121, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the way you used the colour to emphasize the pills is really effective. The blue tone really sets an ominous mood over the image. The composition is well balanced also.</td>', 'I think the way you used the colour to emphasize the pills is really effective. The blue tone really sets an ominous mood over the image. The composition is well balanced also.', '2004-11-06 01:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
