(994629, 118116, 4267, '<td valign="top">not sure I see how this is indecision</td>', 'not sure I see how this is indecision', '2004-11-06 01:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(994633, 118154, 4267, '<td valign="top">good idea for a composition. Meets the challenge without a title. Good crop. There just seems to be something it needs... hmmm.... less light maybe? not sure... it''s like when you cook something and while it tastes good you still think it needs something but your not sure what it is... either way.. (7)</td>', 'good idea for a composition. Meets the challenge without a title. Good crop. There just seems to be something it needs... hmmm.... less light maybe? not sure... it''s like when you cook something and while it tastes good you still think it needs something but your not sure what it is... either way.. (7)', '2004-11-06 01:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
