(994656, 118130, 8759, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W. And the expression. He looks undecided. Good composition and nice use of the square crop. Very good balance between dark and bright. Very neat T-shirt :-) 8 and good luck</td>', 'I like the B&W. And the expression. He looks undecided. Good composition and nice use of the square crop. Very good balance between dark and bright. Very neat T-shirt :-) 8 and good luck', '2004-11-06 02:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(994662, 117946, 8759, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and excellent colours. Very good use of the background. Good composition. Good luck</td>', 'Nice effect and excellent colours. Very good use of the background. Good composition. Good luck', '2004-11-06 02:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
