(994983, 118131, 22010, '<td valign="top">Indeed this is a tough decision. Long exposure shots tend to be all the same but this one isn''t. I think it''s a very original idea and I even like the off angle perspective! Nice.</td>', 'Indeed this is a tough decision. Long exposure shots tend to be all the same but this one isn''t. I think it''s a very original idea and I even like the off angle perspective! Nice.', '2004-11-06 09:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
