(994986, 117814, 22010, '<td valign="top">I suppose the blurriness is intentional. I hope others see that. And definitely taxi.</td>', 'I suppose the blurriness is intentional. I hope others see that. And definitely taxi.', '2004-11-06 09:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(994987, 118025, 22010, '<td valign="top">Yes it does. Depends on where you''re going, what you''re doing. :D I definitely can appreciate the idea here. Good composition.</td>', 'Yes it does. Depends on where you''re going, what you''re doing. :D I definitely can appreciate the idea here. Good composition.', '2004-11-06 09:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(994988, 117923, 22010, '<td valign="top">This isn''t too original. That and the setup is kind of awkward. Everything seems kind of thrown together into the shot.</td>', 'This isn''t too original. That and the setup is kind of awkward. Everything seems kind of thrown together into the shot.', '2004-11-06 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(994989, 118099, 22010, '<td valign="top">Great dilemmas. Nice poses. The most basic dilemmas and you''ve captured it very well. I don''t mind the softness and the slight overexposure adds to the effect.</td>', 'Great dilemmas. Nice poses. The most basic dilemmas and you''ve captured it very well. I don''t mind the softness and the slight overexposure adds to the effect.', '2004-11-06 09:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(994990, 117928, 22010, '<td valign="top">Picture is a bit too dark, and the focus is somewhere I can''t even point out. I definitely see the indecision though.</td>', 'Picture is a bit too dark, and the focus is somewhere I can''t even point out. I definitely see the indecision though.', '2004-11-06 09:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(994992, 118108, 22010, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting, negative space... I even like the fact that the quarter is not entirely there.</td>', 'Good use of lighting, negative space... I even like the fact that the quarter is not entirely there.', '2004-11-06 09:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(994994, 118036, 22010, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a collection. The only think I don''t like about this picture is the color. It seems a bit overexposed at spots. Maybe if it were all in black and white.</td>', 'Wow, what a collection. The only think I don''t like about this picture is the color. It seems a bit overexposed at spots. Maybe if it were all in black and white.', '2004-11-06 09:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
