(995117, 117975, 19311, '<td valign="top">This picture really makes me laugh.  Not to mention the great composition and DOF.  This dog truly is indecision. Good job.  Too bad I can''t vote. 9</td>', 'This picture really makes me laugh.  Not to mention the great composition and DOF.  This dog truly is indecision. Good job.  Too bad I can''t vote. 9', '2004-11-06 12:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
