(997776, 118111, 22010, '<td valign="top">If the beer were open, you wouldn''t care. The only problem I have with this picture is the background. It''s a normal room and therefore, it is very busy and slightly distracting from the subject.</td>', 'If the beer were open, you wouldn''t care. The only problem I have with this picture is the background. It''s a normal room and therefore, it is very busy and slightly distracting from the subject.', '2004-11-07 21:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(997778, 118096, 22010, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this relates to indecision. I can see how it relates to past decisions that may have led to being tardy... Indecision to get on the train maybe. But it''s a stretch. It might have worked better if the focus was the person. Also, the color is a bit off to me.</td>', 'I don''t see how this relates to indecision. I can see how it relates to past decisions that may have led to being tardy... Indecision to get on the train maybe. But it''s a stretch. It might have worked better if the focus was the person. Also, the color is a bit off to me.', '2004-11-07 21:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(997780, 118121, 22010, '<td valign="top">I like this picture except for 1 thing. (It''s not the shadow, I like that) It''s the color. I think it may look better in b&amp;w. The blue doesn''t do it for me. I won''t take points off though. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this picture except for 1 thing. (It''s not the shadow, I like that) It''s the color. I think it may look better in b&w. The blue doesn''t do it for me. I won''t take points off though. Good luck.', '2004-11-07 21:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(997782, 117999, 22010, '<td valign="top">Interesting. It might be even better if you had cropped more, there''s a lot of negative space.</td>', 'Interesting. It might be even better if you had cropped more, there''s a lot of negative space.', '2004-11-07 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(997785, 117942, 22010, '<td valign="top">Too blurry. Busy image. You might''ve tried getting just 1 person, or at least cropping out the unnecessary black bar on the right, person on the left...It''s at least seemingly on topic.</td>', 'Too blurry. Busy image. You might''ve tried getting just 1 person, or at least cropping out the unnecessary black bar on the right, person on the left...It''s at least seemingly on topic.', '2004-11-07 21:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(997786, 117984, 22010, '<td valign="top">I think this is more a choice than indecision. There''s no sense of immediacy with channel surfing.</td>', 'I think this is more a choice than indecision. There''s no sense of immediacy with channel surfing.', '2004-11-07 21:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(997787, 118099, 18838, '<td valign="top">clearly my favorite ... great use of color</td>', 'clearly my favorite ... great use of color', '2004-11-07 21:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(997788, 117966, 22010, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. If it were your truck, the image may be better with a grass background on the right as opposed to another car(busy). On topic.</td>', 'Nice shot. If it were your truck, the image may be better with a grass background on the right as opposed to another car(busy). On topic.', '2004-11-07 21:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(997791, 118128, 22010, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to make of this image. I get it. I''m just not sure if I like it. I certainly don''t dislike it. It''s a little bit blurry. It''s on topic.</td>', 'I don''t know what to make of this image. I get it. I''m just not sure if I like it. I certainly don''t dislike it. It''s a little bit blurry. It''s on topic.', '2004-11-07 21:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(997793, 118143, 22010, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Too bad the leaves were in the way, even if it does help with identifying the location.</td>', 'Good capture. Too bad the leaves were in the way, even if it does help with identifying the location.', '2004-11-07 21:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(997795, 118098, 22010, '<td valign="top">Funny. The archway, which I presume you cut, is kind off. The shot is good though. I think this is one of those instances when a centered subject is actually more deisrable.</td>', 'Funny. The archway, which I presume you cut, is kind off. The shot is good though. I think this is one of those instances when a centered subject is actually more deisrable.', '2004-11-07 21:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(997797, 118004, 22010, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Are they lying on their sides of all up in the air? If the latter, tough capture. Lighting seems to come from multiple sources. Not too distracting. Good composition!</td>', 'Nice capture. Are they lying on their sides of all up in the air? If the latter, tough capture. Lighting seems to come from multiple sources. Not too distracting. Good composition!', '2004-11-07 21:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(997799, 117808, 22010, '<td valign="top">I might''ve cropped it a bit more off the top, but that might degrade image quality/size if that was what stopped you. It''s in focus mostly and it''s on topic. Nice job.</td>', 'I might''ve cropped it a bit more off the top, but that might degrade image quality/size if that was what stopped you. It''s in focus mostly and it''s on topic. Nice job.', '2004-11-07 21:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(997800, 118000, 22010, '<td valign="top">Great effects. I can''t really relate to the indecision though.</td>', 'Great effects. I can''t really relate to the indecision though.', '2004-11-07 21:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(997803, 118144, 22010, '<td valign="top">Nice border. The subject is slightly out of focus though. The composition is excellent.</td>', 'Nice border. The subject is slightly out of focus though. The composition is excellent.', '2004-11-07 22:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(997804, 117935, 22010, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is on topic. It''s more a lack of choice, as opposed to indecision. Interesting train color. Good colors although the sky is kind of depressing. I definitely would''ve cropped out the leaves on the right.</td>', 'I don''t think this is on topic. It''s more a lack of choice, as opposed to indecision. Interesting train color. Good colors although the sky is kind of depressing. I definitely would''ve cropped out the leaves on the right.', '2004-11-07 22:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(997945, 117980, 7504, '<td valign="top">His expression is awesome.  Fun pic!</td>', 'His expression is awesome.  Fun pic!', '2004-11-07 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(997948, 118099, 7504, '<td valign="top">Love how you did this, very clever and fun.</td>', 'Love how you did this, very clever and fun.', '2004-11-07 23:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(998316, 118129, 26679, '<td valign="top">with a sharper focus and this would be up there for me.</td>', 'with a sharper focus and this would be up there for me.', '2004-11-08 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(998333, 118205, 26679, '<td valign="top">I would prefer greater depth of field to get all the text in focus.  As it is, I find the right hand side a little distracting. This is a shame as I love the idea and you have a strong composition.</td>', 'I would prefer greater depth of field to get all the text in focus.  As it is, I find the right hand side a little distracting. This is a shame as I love the idea and you have a strong composition.', '2004-11-08 04:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(998347, 118108, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love this image; I do wonder that if you had shown more space on the left hand side you it would be even stronger.  ( I have tried to do this for you as an idea  have a look in my portfolio)</td>', 'I love this image; I do wonder that if you had shown more space on the left hand side you it would be even stronger.  ( I have tried to do this for you as an idea  have a look in my portfolio)', '2004-11-08 04:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(998352, 118190, 26679, '<td valign="top">Best idea on Indecision I have seen so far</td>', 'Best idea on Indecision I have seen so far', '2004-11-08 04:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(998358, 117850, 26679, '<td valign="top">For me the sepia looses the effect. I suspect the apple is a burgundy red, and the pear a pale washed outish sort of green. If so I would have gone with colour. But thats me.</td>', 'For me the sepia looses the effect. I suspect the apple is a burgundy red, and the pear a pale washed outish sort of green. If so I would have gone with colour. But thats me.', '2004-11-08 04:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(998362, 117964, 26679, '<td valign="top">Can you get both to appear at the same time? - I love the composition and Idea.<br/>I do find the colour a little too harsh/bright on my poor old mince pies (eyes), an wish it were droped just a little</td>', 'Can you get both to appear at the same time? - I love the composition and Idea.I do find the colour a little too harsh/bright on my poor old mince pies (eyes), an wish it were droped just a little', '2004-11-08 04:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(998367, 118036, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good idea and you have some lovely camera here. I just find this composition a little too busy, and therefore somewhat distracting. I find these compositions work best when there is a dominant part of the image, which provides me with somewhere to focus my eyes.</td>', 'Good idea and you have some lovely camera here. I just find this composition a little too busy, and therefore somewhat distracting. I find these compositions work best when there is a dominant part of the image, which provides me with somewhere to focus my eyes.', '2004-11-08 04:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(998370, 117939, 26679, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. A couple of observations, I would prefer more depth of field to see both coins sharp, and perhaps use a slightly softer lighting, as this set up provide too much glare for me.</td>', 'Nice composition. A couple of observations, I would prefer more depth of field to see both coins sharp, and perhaps use a slightly softer lighting, as this set up provide too much glare for me.', '2004-11-08 04:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(998377, 118113, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is the best of the ballot images I have seen. Everything is superbly focused and there is a strong composition.<br/> <br/>The only observation is that this is a theme which is very dominant in the USA, however not every other county has the same level of interest and enthusiasm. (Although with less than 50% turn out in the polls it would suggest that a large number of your countrymen are not enthused..)<br/> <br/>Unfortunately my own countries elections fair no better in turn out.   <br/></td>', 'This is the best of the ballot images I have seen. Everything is superbly focused and there is a strong composition. The only observation is that this is a theme which is very dominant in the USA, however not every other county has the same level of interest and enthusiasm. (Although with less than 50% turn out in the polls it would suggest that a large number of your countrymen are not enthused..) Unfortunately my own countries elections fair no better in turn out.   ', '2004-11-08 04:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(998382, 118106, 26679, '<td valign="top">For me it would have to be a 1iron or a wood. But then as I tell my my good lady, is the quality thats important.</td>', 'For me it would have to be a 1iron or a wood. But then as I tell my my good lady, is the quality thats important.', '2004-11-08 04:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(998384, 118098, 26679, '<td valign="top">This one gave me a smile...</td>', 'This one gave me a smile...', '2004-11-08 04:38:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(998386, 118197, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good spot lighting and composition. I wonder whether the whole brightness could have been lifted slightly more?</td>', 'Good spot lighting and composition. I wonder whether the whole brightness could have been lifted slightly more?', '2004-11-08 04:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(998388, 118155, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like composition and tonal colouring. Looking at the eyes makes me think someone has been surprised, rather than indecision, but then I have found this topic very hard to judge, so have predominantly focussed on the photography.</td>', 'I like composition and tonal colouring. Looking at the eyes makes me think someone has been surprised, rather than indecision, but then I have found this topic very hard to judge, so have predominantly focussed on the photography.', '2004-11-08 04:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(998392, 118046, 26679, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the controller in focus. I find the bottom to be a little blurry and distracting. Which is a shame as its a great idea.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the controller in focus. I find the bottom to be a little blurry and distracting. Which is a shame as its a great idea.', '2004-11-08 04:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(998396, 118078, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good strong composition. I feel that the sepia works well here</td>', 'Good strong composition. I feel that the sepia works well here', '2004-11-08 04:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(998398, 117999, 26679, '<td valign="top">Placing the pasta centrally in the photograph, and parallel with the bottom gives a very static impression. A more dynamic result can be achieved by moving the pasta of centre (rule of thirds) and rotating the pasta on the diagonal.</td>', 'Placing the pasta centrally in the photograph, and parallel with the bottom gives a very static impression. A more dynamic result can be achieved by moving the pasta of centre (rule of thirds) and rotating the pasta on the diagonal.', '2004-11-08 04:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(998399, 118128, 26679, '<td valign="top">as long as you know yor onions.</td>', 'as long as you know yor onions.', '2004-11-08 05:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(998400, 117975, 26679, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that more of this image is not in focus. You would then have a very strong photograph</td>', 'It''s a shame that more of this image is not in focus. You would then have a very strong photograph', '2004-11-08 05:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(998403, 118053, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the idea its certainly original and moving this onto the diagonal would provid a stronger for me.</td>', 'I love the idea its certainly original and moving this onto the diagonal would provid a stronger for me.', '2004-11-08 05:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(998407, 118122, 26679, '<td valign="top">I like this. The idea is not unique in the challenge, and some have even used the same approach. Yours stands out from the rest because the use of your hand is more natural, and the lighting works well in this composition.</td>', 'I like this. The idea is not unique in the challenge, and some have even used the same approach. Yours stands out from the rest because the use of your hand is more natural, and the lighting works well in this composition.', '2004-11-08 05:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(998410, 118003, 26679, '<td valign="top">yes ..  erm..................... n...    no</td>', 'yes ..  erm..................... n...    no', '2004-11-08 05:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(998411, 117903, 26679, '<td valign="top">I believe the term you are looking for is "bar steward"</td>', 'I believe the term you are looking for is "bar steward"', '2004-11-08 05:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(998418, 117984, 26679, '<td valign="top">It would seem to me that the indecision is what to do with the controller; however this is much darker than the TV so you automatically look at the screen.<br/> <br/>On trick to getting a better light balance with a TV in a room is to adjust the TV contrast down before taking the picture.<br/></td>', 'It would seem to me that the indecision is what to do with the controller; however this is much darker than the TV so you automatically look at the screen. On trick to getting a better light balance with a TV in a room is to adjust the TV contrast down before taking the picture.', '2004-11-08 05:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(998421, 117942, 26679, '<td valign="top">The strength of this image is lost because of the focus used on the two characters. I perhaps would have cropped the person on the left out of the photograph.</td>', 'The strength of this image is lost because of the focus used on the two characters. I perhaps would have cropped the person on the left out of the photograph.', '2004-11-08 05:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(998423, 118132, 19035, '<td valign="top">This shot was done in choices, check it out...its image # 83981.</td>', 'This shot was done in choices, check it out...its image # 83981.', '2004-11-08 05:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(998436, 118003, 12131, '<td valign="top">Haha, you cheat! I like the comedy in it but an all blank photo just can''t score highly in my book.</td>', 'Haha, you cheat! I like the comedy in it but an all blank photo just can''t score highly in my book.', '2004-11-08 06:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(998447, 117903, 5933, '<td valign="top">Broken pencil a bit too dramatic.</td>', 'Broken pencil a bit too dramatic.', '2004-11-08 06:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
