(998861, 118129, 2337, '<td valign="top">Soft focus is a tad too soft here... Compositions and concept are good, but the lack of focus killed this shot for me... But that''s just me, and what do I know :)</td>', 'Soft focus is a tad too soft here... Compositions and concept are good, but the lack of focus killed this shot for me... But that''s just me, and what do I know :)', '2004-11-08 11:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
