(998882, 117892, 2337, '<td valign="top">Soft focus from depth of field on the front pieces doesn''t add much to me... I like the "hand out of the darkness"... The knight is being moved, it only has one square it can go to (kb3), so I''m not sure I see the "indecision" here...But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)</td>', 'Soft focus from depth of field on the front pieces doesn''t add much to me... I like the "hand out of the darkness"... The knight is being moved, it only has one square it can go to (kb3), so I''m not sure I see the "indecision" here...But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)', '2004-11-08 11:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
