(998968, 117884, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yikes.   I hope whoever was in that car made it out okay!   Though obviously it''s not a beautiful photo, it draws you in, and it''s sharp and well done.</td>', 'Yikes.   I hope whoever was in that car made it out okay!   Though obviously it''s not a beautiful photo, it draws you in, and it''s sharp and well done.', '2004-11-08 12:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
