(999002, 118192, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot.  It not only conveys the challenge well, but it''s a cool, interesting picture.   9</td>', 'I like this picture a lot.  It not only conveys the challenge well, but it''s a cool, interesting picture.   9', '2004-11-08 12:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
