(1000334, 118154, 12573, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I would have given you an 8 purely on the phenomenal composition (you got a 9 from me though, since it was a perfect fit to the challenge).  Cropping out the lower half of his (your?) face really reinforces that the man is thinking about the decision.  It''s a problem a lot of us face (or rather, don''t face) everyday and that is what appeals to me.  Congrats.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-09 02:23:50.</i></td>', 'Well done.  I would have given you an 8 purely on the phenomenal composition (you got a 9 from me though, since it was a perfect fit to the challenge).  Cropping out the lower half of his (your?) face really reinforces that the man is thinking about the decision.  It''s a problem a lot of us face (or rather, don''t face) everyday and that is what appeals to me.  Congrats.', '2004-11-09 02:23:25.000000', '2004-11-09 02:23:50.000000', 0),
