(1000373, 117814, 93, '<td valign="top">I really want to thank everyone that commented on this shot, and were nice enough to say that they understood the blur to it.<br/> <br/>For everyone else that quick-voted and said, in their tiny little pea-minds, "This is blurry, 1." I say... PPPHHHHHHBBBBBTTTTT!!!!!<br/> <br/>For all of you that voted low because this is more about choice than indecision..  yes, technically I agree.  However, for anyone that has never been blitzed out of their mind so that reaching for a set of car keys actually *looks* like this shot from out your own eyes..  you can''t possibly know just how much indecision goes into a decision like this at that point.   All your intellect and reasoning is *GONE*.<br/> <br/>I just wanted to say that.<br/></td>', 'I really want to thank everyone that commented on this shot, and were nice enough to say that they understood the blur to it. For everyone else that quick-voted and said, in their tiny little pea-minds, "This is blurry, 1." I say... PPPHHHHHHBBBBBTTTTT!!!!! For all of you that voted low because this is more about choice than indecision..  yes, technically I agree.  However, for anyone that has never been blitzed out of their mind so that reaching for a set of car keys actually *looks* like this shot from out your own eyes..  you can''t possibly know just how much indecision goes into a decision like this at that point.   All your intellect and reasoning is *GONE*. I just wanted to say that.', '2004-11-09 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
