(2037566, 117965, 37334, '<td valign="top">This was before my time, so it''s my first time seeing it. What a wonderful image! It should be a poster for our times! We''ve all been granted the wonderful faculty of thought and reasoning, but how many people actually use it 100%? In fact in most people it has atrophied...what a wonderful symbolic representation of this.</td>', 'This was before my time, so it''s my first time seeing it. What a wonderful image! It should be a poster for our times! We''ve all been granted the wonderful faculty of thought and reasoning, but how many people actually use it 100%? In fact in most people it has atrophied...what a wonderful symbolic representation of this.', '2006-01-15 03:39:39.000000', NULL, 0),
